---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /collections/
title: "Seasonal collections"
description: "Cross-category collections from Grandma Rose's kitchen. Holiday dishes, Sunday supper, potluck standbys, and canning season."
---
<section class="wrap-narrow center">
  <p class="subtitle">Seasonal</p>
  <h1>Collections</h1>
  <p class="lede muted">Cross-category collections pulled from the tin box. What the family expects at holidays, on Sunday afternoons, at potlucks, and through canning season.</p>
</section>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="tile-grid">
    {% for coll in seasons %}
    <a class="card category-tile reveal" href="/collections/{{ coll.slug }}/">
      <div class="category-tile__glyph">{% svg coll.glyph %}</div>
      <h2 class="category-tile__name">{{ coll.name }}</h2>
      <p class="category-tile__group">A seasonal collection</p>
      <p class="recipe-card__blurb">{{ coll.blurb }}</p>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
